1. Jumbotron — katta ajratilgan blok
<div class="jumbotron">
    <h1>Bootstrap Tutorial</h1>
    <p>
        Bootstrap is the most popular HTML, CSS, and JS framework
        for developing responsive, mobile-first projects on the web.
    </p>
</div>
2. Jumbotron Inside Container

Agar jumbotron ekranning chetlarigacha bormasin desak:
<div class="container">

    <div class="jumbotron">
        <h1>Bootstrap Tutorial</h1>
        <p>
            Bootstrap is the most popular HTML, CSS, and JS framework
            for developing responsive, mobile-first projects on the web.
        </p>
    </div>

    <p>This is some text.</p>
    <p>This is another text.</p>

</div>
3. Jumbotron Outside Container

Agar jumbotron ekranning chetlarigacha yoyilsin desak:
<div class="jumbotron">

    <h1>Bootstrap Tutorial</h1>

    <p>
        Bootstrap is the most popular HTML, CSS, and JS framework
        for developing responsive, mobile-first projects on the web.
    </p>

</div>

<div class="container">

    <p>This is some text.</p>
    <p>This is another text.</p>

</div>
.container ichida
→ jumbotron chetlargacha bormaydi

.container tashqarisida
→ jumbotron ekran kengligida chiqadi
4. Page Header

.page-header → heading ostiga gorizontal chiziq qo‘shadi va biroz bo‘sh joy beradi.
<div class="page-header">
    <h1>My First Page</h1>
</div>
.jumbotron   → katta ajratilgan blok

.container   → contentni cheklangan kenglikda ushlab turadi

.page-header → heading ostiga chiziq + bo‘sh joy
Jumbotron    → katta va e'tibor tortuvchi blok
Page Header  → sarlavhani boshqa sectionlardan ajratish
